 about 90percent certain i know how to fix the problem with it not hurting peoplewhen they drink it.  The problem is /obj/soft_drink has a build in drink function that over rides your drink function.  In order to fixthis you should put in an a void init with an add_action for drinkthis should fix it**atsui**To: brainsprainSubj: that fat bitch debbieCc: finger, bladeDate: Feb 23dude-she told me that the monk guild is 'protected' from thieves.... what the fuckdoes this mean?? all i know is that i backstabbed a level 18 monk and she didn't die.... that is definitely a problem.please get back to me on this. i'd mail blade but i think he's dead.  atsui**quilt**To: manglaSubj: thievesCc: blade, brainsprain, septianDate: Jul 30ok i basically am gonna compare thieves and monks (cos you guys already wiped out the other guilds)monks can hide in dark - why?monks have death blows..fine..they can use them as many times as they want..thieves only get one backstabdeath blow does 2/3 damage of backstab i supposemonks have HEAPS of other combat abilitiesadmittedly..some of those abilities are shit..but when you consider that we only have onedoesn't seem to make sensenow i'm not trying to take down monks...(although they are overpowered) but thieves are now too underpowered without ambush or throw..now they were buggy (or so blade told me)..fair enough..but surely we can get something to complement backstaband i think also that most of the thief abilities are pk orientated..because to put it simply they are relevant to most npcs who a)have more hp and b)are not effected by mudballs and stuffanyway..i had a few suggestions in the past..i'll mail them to you if you like..P.S. we don't want to powerup backstab..just want some combat options**"
